cription":"CH0176_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"すみません！遅くなりました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/QN1eWK2IpJurggUgBEztpyPzFWHLjF1b.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"到着しました！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/KM8bdzUplIhY7Bep7SUxio53svJQCSoM.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"こんなに凄いものを、私に…先生にはいつも、色んな物を頂いてばかりですね。少しでもお返しできるよう、引き続き頑張ります！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/bXM8oc3Gx3BbqFNPmlvXmT0SZC7PfkZ4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"はい！お任せください！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/dZ1P40BYfNvSYsJzSUPosd9xBLpi9y8f.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"整備はもうパッチリです！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/OOdfZtecdhpamyN0Gncw8ppVCvfO0blv.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"お、奥空アヤネです。ど、どうでしょうか…こういう格好は、少し恥ずかしいですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/ZfkONdW7B3iPYfAqJ5WY7dczNRVuZQul.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"その、いつもありがとうございます、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/HE2HSeYSww5rlwrtb6mSpbDgEDPAuuiV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"本当に、いつもありがとうございます。このご恩は、必ず。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/AWixJDMTSrl97t4lHCSbXoDMPJMe9T2z.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"うふふ。なんだか先生には、いつも助けていただいてばかりですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/EQ0rvpgduUyc2cllvwylyjE4Ms3jF2Hh.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"いつも助けられてばかりなので、私も頑張ります。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/PV0BKopn9cwPm4hrzLcZkFPnTXoHPSM3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"えっと…ど、どうされましたか…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/gS1lACE7cMh4BECslbeoJ9Q1JEcKSGDs.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"こ、この格好ですか？ え、えっと…夏っぽさを出してみようと…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/PIbgJQSjbLkmzFCKWIgFTTMJhd9Q9gFu.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ど、どうですか？に、似合ってますでしょうか…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/OKRDO1FEa7l13uapwN96AHLQ88VJdfsh.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"いつもあれをしなきゃ、これをしなきゃって考えてばかりだったので… 何だかこういうゆったりした時間は、不思議な気分です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/LsddAvcBNryyfotcLavihl2r8ZiYeejT.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"この格好ですと、何だか気が緩んでしまいますね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kJNsfR8QIE5f9xwJQ9olaTQFaQifgr1y.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あっ、おかえりなさい、先生！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/7deBwD60VYzcL87dEmzNZGyOecB73CJN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生、お待ちしておりました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/pdTSsq4UIci1XvRmjxeVhKTWo4rfGAiv.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"えっと、私はこの辺りの、端っこに写っていれば良いでしょうか…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Sd1bLcABmdvqtIvl6wJhcqxhLJCWEkdq.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"こんな感じで、大丈夫ですかね…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/bydju0jzuXYJTytYgZVj08Bp6m2gCoEV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ど、どうすればヘリが際立つんでしょう…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/8wRfwke6yZIT5K8sIv7JhEjLsfmj3GLM.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"すみません、こういうのはあまり慣れてなくって…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/yEPf23I6Dkr8fP0lHskyk6XzdLq6uJtW.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"えっと…先生？修理の記念写真ということでしたら…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/1ycs5LQsYudpvbgy4MmGn4seNsip8Tlk.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"もっとヘリを中心に撮った方が良いのでは…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/FbVTydr43xjo8hIkEQ6aa8GaAqOpuo9P.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"…え、ヘリではなくて、私の記念写真…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/i6YntKfIzBXi4IN6kNetQMEsSEkmz5Dl.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"そ、そうだったんですか！？えぇっ！？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/BM1Zvz9qkqdnCOybATKIgpNysmKPxLmC.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"そ、それはその、いえ、嫌ではないですが…！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/VKrg1369Am7z4JloKQWr4NRwrGUzSxwd.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"な、何だか急に、顔が熱く…っ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/tznnJswbOCdNgBOwh92Kt2nMpgbqvUtY.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"いつもと雰囲気が違う、ですか…？そ、そうでしょうか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/gnu0OY1MPnsatg0E0Z2nw42nPrSPNKpj.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"この瞬間が、ずっと続いたら良いなって、思ってしまいます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/H8EltIsbnjGtEon3qOEdTJVctO5FRHUv.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"水着だからでしょうか？なんだかいつもより……こう、つい浮かれてしまうといいますか……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/3dawFi65cKGKm7RXc0IHxYhSKsfLYuD6.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"ありがとうございます。本当に心から感謝しているんです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/A3QrNaQvvE4Nzj1sErb2KnnkZxS8ESKM.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Season_Birthday_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"せ、先生…その…き、今日は、えっと…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/YxzTgvuVhktcos1fhOmd15JZOqg4N5w9.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Season_Birthday_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あっ…ありがとう、ございます。こうしていられるだけで嬉しいのに、誕生日まで祝ってもらって… 贅沢な一日です","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/x01qM80T2tiYXZwlYSK1lVq333WckHa9.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生！ 先生と出会えたこと、こうしてゆっくりと過ごせること…本当に嬉しく思います。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/pMphjaXEZY5e47QFPmpHeGzzlh7FbT5i.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"なるほど、ハロウィンだからみなさん仮装を… あ、いえ、私のこれはそういう意味ではなく…！？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/pjTzIxwXrHNvDiYeafqMVD7bewWiNHKU.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"新年あけましておめでとうございます！ 今年もたくさん、楽しいことがあるように願ってます！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/l81LiEX6cCMSO7SzrxIGPmERpjTzQYzw.ogg"},{"description":"CH0176_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"メリークリスマス！な、何かリアクションを頂けないと、恥ずかしいです…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/bggfbmdGhaTVIOzrmsORGmdGmGbREpiQ.ogg"},{"description":"SM017601_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"攻撃します！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/SM017601_CommonSkill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"どうかされましたか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0176_formation_select.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0176_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"在，在这里打扮成这样，有，有点害羞……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"欸，大家都去哪儿了……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"在哪里可以好好放松呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"嗯……？那是什么……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"总觉得好开心呀。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"开始火力支援！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"老，老师……？有什么事吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"怎，怎么了……？难道我身上有虫子……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"诶……老师，您叫我了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"不，不好意思。您这样一直看着我，我会害羞的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"老师，欢迎光临！准备工作就交给我吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"老师，我正等着您呢。一起加油吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"好，加油上吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"只要再加把劲就能解决了。老师，加油吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"善后也是很重要的。我来帮您吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventmission_1","category":"event","text":"一个个完成目标的感觉真不错呀。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventmission_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventmission_2","category":"event","text":"即使只是在一起整理目标清单，我也觉得很开心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventmission_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventmission_day_end","category":"event","text":"今天的目标已经全部完成了，谢谢老师！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventmission_day_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventmission_get_1","category":"event","text":"您辛苦了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventmission_get_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventmission_get_2","category":"event","text":"不愧是老师！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventmission_get_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventmission_login_1","category":"event","text":"目标清单我已经整理好了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventmission_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_eventmission_login_2","category":"event","text":"这些就是本次的目标。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_eventmission_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"我也来帮忙！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"这次不再是后方支援，我也要上了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"请再等等！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"久等了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"抱歉，我来晚了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"已经抵达！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"要把这么贵重的东西送给我吗……老师对我总是这么好呢。为了报答您，我会继续努力的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"好的，交给我吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"已经做好准备了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我，我是奥空绫音。您，您觉得如何呢……打扮成这样，我有点不好意思。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"老，老师，感谢您一直以来的照顾！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"真的很感谢您，我一定会报答您的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，总感觉一直都在接受老师的帮助呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"我总是在接受别人的帮助，我也会加油的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"呃……怎，怎么了吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"这，这身打扮……？想，想稍微打扮得像夏天一点，所以就……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"怎，怎么样？还，还算好看吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"我每天都忙得焦头烂额的……没想到居然还能像现在这样悠闲，真是不可思议啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"不知道为什么，一打扮成这样，就会不知不觉地放松下来了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊！老，老师，欢迎回来！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师。我正等您呢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，我就站在这旁边可以吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"这样拍，没问题吧……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"要，要怎么才能把直升机拍得更清楚呢……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"不好意思，我还不太习惯这样拍照……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"……老师？既然是在给这次维修拍照留念……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"是不是，多拍拍直升机会更好呢……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯？要留念的不是直升机，而是我吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"原，原来是这样吗？！诶？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"我，我我我，我不是不喜欢这样……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"只，只是不知道为什么脸上突然变得很烫……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"给人的感觉，和平时不太一样？是，是吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"如果这一刻，能成为永恒就好了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"是因为穿了泳装吗？总感觉，心情比平时更激动了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"谢谢，我发自内心的感谢您！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_season_birthday_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"老，老师……今，今天……嗯……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_season_birthday_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_season_birthday_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊……谢，谢谢您！光是和老师待在一起就很开心了，没想到还能收到您的生日祝福……真是奢侈的一天呀。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_season_birthday_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您生日快乐！能遇见老师，能和老师一起度过这样悠闲的时光……我真的很开心！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老，老师，祝您新春快乐！即使是我，今天也会好好休息的！请您先放下手头的工作，和我一起好好享受今天吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"原来如此，因为是万圣节，所以大家才会穿上特别的服装……不，不是的，我不是因为这个才穿的……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师，祝您中秋快乐！您，您想和我一起，在直升机上赏月吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"祝您新年快乐！希望老师今年也能碰到各种各样的好事情！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐——！……请，请您说点什么吧，不然我会很害羞的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"ch0176_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0176_title.ogg"},{"description":"sm017601_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"开始攻击！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A5%A5%E7%A9%BA%20%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/sm017601_commonskill.ogg"}],"voice